  "description": {
    "en": "Plugin market index for dsh-hindsight-memory, the DeepSeek Harness plugin that lets DSH and omp (oh-my-pi) share Hindsight memory with identical semantics and a selectable memory scope. Add the raw URL of this file under Plugins > Discover > Index sources.",
    "zh": "dsh-hindsight-memory 的插件市场索引。DSH 的「插件 → 发现 → 索引源」里填入本文件的 raw URL 即可看到本插件。本插件让 DSH 与 omp 共用 Hindsight 记忆库，语义一致，记忆作用域可选。"
  },
